# Nouns that count people or things a clock never takes: a bare hour behind a
# clock preposition and directly before one of them is a count ("wave at 5
# people").  Each word is quoted from its Wiktionary Noun entry
# (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/<word>); the fetched pages are kept with the audit.
# persona: Noun. "person"
# persones: Noun. "plural of persona"
# convidats: Noun. "plural of convidat"
# amics: Noun. "plural of amic"
# amigues: Noun. "plural of amiga"
# nens: Noun. "plural of nen"
# nenes: Noun. "plural of nena"
# noies: Noun. "plural of noia"
# nois: Noun. "plural of noi"
# adults: Noun. "plural of adult"
# jugadors: Noun. "plural of jugador"
# seients: Noun. "plural of seient"
# taules: Noun. "plural of taula"
# entrades: Noun. "plural of entrada"
# habitacions: Noun. "plural of habitació"
persona
persones
convidats
amics
amigues
nens
nenes
noies
nois
adults
jugadors
seients
taules
entrades
habitacions
